    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d510">

                <pb facs="0560" n="456" sameAs="frus:frus1932v05/pg456"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.00 Revolutions/141: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Culbertson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-07-06T15:00:00-05:00">July 6, 1932—3
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 4:18 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>121. My telegram No. 99, June 18, 10 a.m. Luís Barriga yesterday definitely
                    accepted appointment as Minister for Foreign Affairs.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Culbertson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
